The one question: in which pre-declared regime, if any, does a *positive*
interaction term exist at all?

Around the carrier anchor ``a0`` the interaction residual is necessarily mostly
negative (users collide on the same good beams).  Re-anchored at a certified
iterated unilateral optimum ``u`` every legal single-user move is non-improving
under the coordinator objective, so any strictly improving *joint* move from
